WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.177
No hyperinvariant subspace at all.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.427
The operators commuting with T move any

3
00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:08.054
nonzero vector arbitrarily close to any other.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.274
Build an operator whose powers fade, whose commuting operators can reach everywhere.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.382
Claimed: it exists on every separable Hilbert space.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.259
Lean-checked main theorem.
